==Battleground==
*12 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[E. Honda (Enemy)|E. Honda]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns.
**6 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

